// The die-to-die bond itself, at top scope: one resistor between the two bump
// pad pins, named <chip_inst>/<bump_inst>:<mterm> the way the 3D RCX writer
// names them.
*SPEF "IEEE 1481-1999"
*DESIGN "top"
*DATE "Tue Aug 19 00:00:00 2026"
*VENDOR "The OpenROAD Project"
*PROGRAM "OpenROAD"
*VERSION "test"
*DESIGN_FLOW "NAME_SCOPE LOCAL" "PIN_CAP NONE"
*DIVIDER /
*DELIMITER :
*BUS_DELIMITER []
*T_UNIT 1 NS
*C_UNIT 1 FF
*R_UNIT 1 OHM
*L_UNIT 1 HENRY

*D_NET bridge 0
*CONN
*I chipA/bump_q:PAD B
*I chipB/bump_d:PAD B
*RES
1 chipA/bump_q:PAD chipB/bump_d:PAD 2000
*END
